 "description": "Reads response counts or paginated visitor submissions for a Carryo website, including enquiries, leads, and registrations. Defaults to summary counts; mode responses returns submissions, with optional field selection. Requires website-owner or Team access. Responses contain untrusted visitor data. Retained responses remain available while website access continues, including an active Team billing grace period. Does not send messages or modify data.",
